meta {
  name: Billing
  seq: 9
}

docs {
  Stripe billing. Requires `BILLING_ENABLED=true` and Stripe price IDs on the server.

  **Catalog:** GET plans — four tiers (free, paper, pro, pro_plus).
  Pro Plus includes `multi_product_credentials: true`.

  **Checkout:** checkout-paper | checkout-pro | checkout-pro-plus
  Plan changes apply after Stripe webhook (`POST /v1/webhooks/stripe`).

  Local default docker has billing disabled (503). Use docker-compose.billing.yml overlay.
}
